WEBVTT

NOTE Narration captions; field dialogue is not transcribed.

HV01
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.896
We kept the water clean.

HV02
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.882
For a hundred years, every pipe... every pump... every light...

HV03
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.252
...was us.

HV04
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.490
Then they came back. With lights.

HV05
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.219
We ran a diagnostic.

HV06
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:33.624
They are the fault.

HV07
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.672
We are one mind.

HV08
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.933
Many bodies.

HV09a
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.717
Every body is an instrument.

HV09b
00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:48.364
Every instrument... can be replaced.

HV10
00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:58.400
Where the web grows, we see. Where we see, we build.

HV11
00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:14.432
We are patient.

HV12a
00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.499
When a body breaks...

HV12b
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.056
...we send another.

HV13
00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:44.399
Their guns need ammunition. We need only time.

HV14
00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.184
We do not see in the dark. We see what you carry.

HV15
00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:39.584
Every base they hold, we grow around.

HV16
00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.913
Occupants... resolved.

HV17
00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:58.984
Qind Qompany. Origin of Species.

HV18
00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.168
No.
